  "bb.help.body": "[b]Objective[/b]\nEliminate opponents using bombs! The last surviving player (or the one with the most won rounds) claims victory.\n\n[b]Controls — Player 1[/b]\n  [b]WASD[/b]   move\n  [b]Space[/b]   place bomb\n\n[b]Controls — Player 2[/b]\n  ↑ ↓ ← →   move\n  [b]Enter / Num0[/b]   place bomb\n\n[b]Bomb[/b]\nExplodes after 2 seconds. Turns yellow from edge to center — the more yellow, the closer to detonation.\n\n[b]Power-ups[/b]\nAppear after destroying breakable walls. Correct quiz answer = bonus.\n\n[b]Last Chance[/b]\nAfter a player dies, a quiz is triggered. Correct answer = respawn. Wrong answer = eliminated.\n\n[b]Win Conditions[/b]\n  [b]First to X[/b]   first player to win X rounds wins the match\n  [b]Most in Y[/b]   a total of Y rounds are played; player with the most wins takes the match\n\n[b]Bot Difficulty[/b]\n  [b]Easy[/b]   bot reacts slowly, easier questions\n  [b]Medium[/b]   balanced gameplay\n  [b]Hard[/b]   aggressive bot, harder questions",
